OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FSchoolgirl Lily visits Dr Devin
OL,7,     FGray. Her mum is concerned she
OL,8,     Fcould have glandular fever.
OL,9,     FMorteza has a condition known as
OL,10,     Fspinal stenosis and his back pain
OL,11,     Fis getting worse.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FAt Barnsley casualty, a man runs
OL,14,     Fin with a major stab wound,
OL,15,     F91-year-old Brenda has had a nasty
OL,16,     Ffall, and five-year-old Greyson
OL,17,     Fhas swallowed a marble.
